## Context

Child of 1654. The ledger is frozen (see the log); this ticket records the disposition so nothing is lost and no job is restarted by accident. The old labels stay in the append-only tables as a cross-check and as a source of clear negatives, never as truth.

The 63,558 chaining works that were still unresolved under the old screening are not screened by it; they wait for the new scorer.

## Exit criteria

- [x] No provider batch is live: waves 02, 03, 05, 07 cancelled, waves 01, 04, 06 completed, Haiku batch ended (provider status read 2026-10-10).
- [x] `data/rel_chaining/2026-10-08/budget.sqlite` has no open reservation; every row settled; totals quoted in the log.
- [x] A disposition note lists what is retired (runners, scripts, waivers) and what stays (labels, ledgers, archives), and the screening-half commits of branch `t1654-citation-chaining` are preserved by a tag before the branch is deleted.
- [x] The archive `data/rel_chaining/2026-10-08/` is pushed to DVC or its location stated, so the ledger and answers survive the worktree.
- [x] The waived or accepted residues of the old screening (296 stage-2 residues, 59 title-less works, the waived final audit) are listed in the 1656 freeze inputs as limitations, not carried into the new pipeline.
